  "description": "The Torque has proven to be one of our most versatile bikes in the line up. We have seen riders and heard and stories of daily commutes to fully loaded bike packing. The CroMo frame with cast dropouts is a modern mountain bike frame, designed for large tires and a rigid fork. The Torque has 650b wheels and large 2.4\" tires for all around-‘ness’. Wide 760mm Mountain Bike style handle bars for control and aggressive stance to match the tires, Shimano hydraulic brakes, and a 1x10 Speed Drivetrain make this one of the most unique bikes on the market. Torque could be a city shopping bike, an urban commuter, rise around city bike, or even a trail bike right out of the box. It has grown in to an ultra capable touring bike, as well as a winter bike. 27.5 x 2.4 tires, and more room for a larger front ring, or even 2x capability.",
